% \begin{macro}{\@@_snap:,\@@_both_bare_direction:,\@@_infer_anchors:}
%   Infer the anchors of bare ends from the direction a wire travels in.
%   With one end anchored, the wire travels as it leaves that end, or as it enters it; a diagonal, from a corner, is snapped to the axis of the flow, if set, else to the axis that separates the two ends more.
